{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0354_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7b3ce709e82fe4baf8c713e0d913fef24518fbeaf03f841f45b0a5ba7f8c8312", "ja": "（ジュリアの新しい衣装が届いた。衣装のテーマは、\n『キラキラのお姫様』ということだけど……）", "zh": "（茱莉亚的新衣服送到了。衣服的主题是“闪闪发光的公主”，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0354_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "91f07daa229b7667ed591fb226b4d1218a4a3f6b71776759ecbbbae51b702447", "ja": "うぅ……これ、本当にあたしかよ……。", "zh": "呜……这真的是我吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0354_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3dc162063e56d83720dcfa5a9c848ea7da9aebf5c0c9b5532c3971d77bc92be5", "ja": "ジュリア、お疲れ様。\nおお、いいじゃないか！", "zh": "茱莉亚，辛苦了。\n哦，不错嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0354_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "d6e55c90c2dff45227bd5b4b13ef6cfe02e08458e014659121c54d2742f9c10d", "ja": "うわっ、{$P$}！？\n衣装の確認だよな！　それなら問題ないよ。", "zh": "哇啊，{$P$}！？\n你是来确认服装的吧！那方面完全没问题哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0354_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "1e2a54912844f627a62710955978bfa3f3d1ac3433c56675cfcca1c9e72a97aa", "ja": "むしろ問題なのは、あたしの気持ちかな。\n……あんたならわかるだろ？", "zh": "有问题的倒不如说是我这边的情绪吧。\n……你心里应该清楚吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0354_1005_p", "source_sha256": "24afb4b91474cef25cf4d7c28003d02ac9e22e259e586674b80cf8ba8484758d", "ja": "もちろん。衣装、すごい気に入ってくれたんだな！", "zh": "当然懂了。看来你超级喜欢这套服装啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0354_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "42d2a8ef64c6c1a40a12601bffa3e7cd144bd073965ce1d03a67e386a6f61eea", "ja": "違っ……いや、違わないけど、違うんだって！\n恥ずかしいんだよ！　こんな全身カワイイのが！", "zh": "不是……不，也不是，但不是那个意思！很害羞啊！全身上下都这么可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0354_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "0467d2c062fdfb4d97a386faef7fd1c94e90fc213a969ccf26ee119af4c7603f", "ja": "髪も衣装もガラじゃないだろ？\nいつものあたしと違いすぎて、違和感があるんだよ。", "zh": "头发和服装都不适合我吧？和我平时的样子差太多了，总觉得很别扭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0354_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b981c2500e1c4d256c5a66784e5c381e1390a7227454222e873886ff0446e544", "ja": "それがいいんじゃないか！　普段との違いが\n大きいからこそ、より魅力的に見えるんだ！", "zh": "这样不是很好吗！正因为和平时的差别很大，才显得更有魅力啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0354_1009_p", "source_sha256": "63de7b21b27b5d0a4fb438a046b114d8b94103ced6f228f0e9f8a38a81b96f8a", "ja": "お姫様なんだから、恥ずかしさは一旦忘れて、\n堂々としていればいいんだよ。", "zh": "既然是公主，就先暂时忘掉害羞，大大方方地表现自己就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0354_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "278bfc1793d3113a2a7018dff2f4d65cc2380ad2dbede2194f387f732996ddb6", "ja": "簡単に言うなよな……。\nお姫様になりきれって言うけど、どうすればいいんだ？", "zh": "别说得那么轻松啊……\n你说要彻底演成公主，可到底该怎么做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0354_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "5e5f5aaee2a74c70800d6dadf4d923dcf515ef40d8fbdb1122202a6503a53928", "ja": "お城に住んでたり、馬車に乗ったりするんだろ？\nあたしにそんな経験ないしさ……。", "zh": "不是住在城堡里，就是坐着马车到处跑吧？\n我可没有那种经历啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0354_1012_p", "source_sha256": "27372bdc8fa742f015297904a384cb480600b992305521103414102af0cdcbd0", "ja": "そうだな……。それなら、お姫様になったつもりで、\n歌詞を書いてみるのはどうだ？", "zh": "是啊……那么，要不要试着把自己当成公主，写写歌词呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0354_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "7f19748875825b06b17d9973963f58dcb416100c77ef2b5e7adafd3192ba5a89", "ja": "歌詞を？　……なるほどな。作詞を通して、\nお姫様のイメージを膨らませてくってわけか。", "zh": "歌词？……原来如此。也就是说，要通过作词来丰富公主的形象啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0354_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "885b1c9d57c28d5383131efe149308bdbde691706b44e5534e317c396d91ad89", "ja": "それだったら……まあ。\nあともう少し、これだって要素があるといいかもな。", "zh": "如果是这样……嗯。\n要是再多一些能体现这一点的要素，或许会更好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0354_1015_p", "source_sha256": "549121350203f45c301bf052eeace1cb918de8ebfc533e27863ee210fa21d420", "ja": "それなら、まつりに声をかけてみないか？\nきっと、いろんな話が聞けると思うぞ。", "zh": "那样的话，要不要试着去找茉莉聊聊？\n我想一定能听到各种各样的故事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0354_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "9ea20a1a00fa549d1fd37a39e877685cda8e8a264a04912101c67eec55dd2f72", "ja": "いいな、それ。マツなら、いろんなエピソードが\n聞けそうだ。あとで話してみるよ。", "zh": "这个不错。要是茉莉的话，应该能听到各种各样的逸闻。\n之后我去跟她聊聊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0354_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "9f7e8b93190f0e0d6285d19ddd95595bf633b0ea0a8ba374c4fd43f85b9a9bc3", "ja": "それじゃ、さっそく……。\nイメージは『星から来たお姫様』ってとこかな♪", "zh": "那就马上开始……  \n主题就定成《来自星星的公主》吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0354_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c0f52fa62dd322e140fca21fd42651364957acdb93859ad76b946565413f5936", "ja": "おっ、衣装にピッタリだな。\nちなみに、ひとつ言い忘れてたけど……。", "zh": "哦，这和服装完全搭配呢。\n顺便说一句，我好像忘了一件事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0354_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "6b1c5a3b9ce25cbf2756a5381a5b86eea49744d8a29d2897bcc35bfc4e2a40a3", "ja": "ん？　なんだ？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0354_1020_p", "source_sha256": "38b425c0cdae978e1bfa147b4e829e32e95c6dd2e3103bb9803c70d0311700cd", "ja": "ジュリアがお姫様のガラじゃないってことはないぞ。\nよく似合ってるし、すごい可愛いからな！", "zh": "说茱莉亚不是公主的料，那可不对。很适合你，而且特别可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0354_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "812063da2264ed7e88e6b4ae20e9b1f784a907d901f417c377f89c0d7c1526b1", "ja": "そ、そういうのは言わなくていいんだよ、バカPー！\nせっかく忘れてたのに……くぅ。", "zh": "这、这种话不用说啦，笨蛋制作人——！\n好不容易才忘掉的……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
